            "id": "2ceb9a87-9948-340b-afbd-e7d67ad7318d",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Are energy constraints the only risk to AI momentum?",
            "description": "<p>While OpenAI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT\">OPAI.PVT</a>) CEO Sam Altman<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/openai-vs-google-why-sam-150443385.html\"> issues a \"code red\" on growing AI competition</a> from hyperscalers like Alphabet's Google (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>), Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>) CEO Satya Nadella has stated that AI operators need \"social permission\" for large-scale energy consumption.</p>\n<p>Sevens Report Research Founder Tom Essaye and Yahoo Finance senior reporters <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/ines-ferre/\">Ines Ferr\u00e9</a> join executive editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> for a discussion on the biggest threats to the AI Revolution's momentum.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "While OpenAI (OPAI.PVT) CEO Sam Altman issues a \"code red\" on growing AI competition from hyperscalers like Alphabet's Google (GOOG, GOOGL), Microsoft (MSFT) CEO Satya Nadella has stated that AI operators need \"social permission\" for large-scale energy consumption. Sevens Report Research Founder Tom Essaye and Yahoo Finance senior reporters Brooke DiPalma and Ines Ferr\u00e9 join executive editor Brian Sozzi for a discussion on the biggest threats to the AI Revolution's momentum. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Opening Bid.",
